      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Alright, so someone pointed out an issue with this that I had tested but incorrectly, thus assuming it worked. \nIt would still need something to track the player's root (playspace) or it'll be misaligned when the player moves.\nJust wanted to point that out, it would not be as easy as a drag & drop, but still it'd be an option! (And would work perfectly if there was a script to get the root, as suggested in Phasedragon's feature request canny)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
